summary:
  "Back to live" touches the player without raising the header's keep.

history:
  Reported by the listener on 2026-09-21: back from a pause the cover was
  gone and had to be waited for. The shift flag went down and the player was
  stopped in one breath, and the stopped edge wiped title and cover. The
  engine raises a bounded keep first; this takes the raise away.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          liveReturnAt = nowMs > 0 ? nowMs : 0;   // no clock, no keep

replace:
          liveReturnAt = 0;   // no clock, no keep

expect:
  Killed by tst_timeshiftengine::test_back_to_live_raises_the_keep_before_it_touches_the_player.
  Line-neutral.
